### POST `/v1/responses/input_tokens`: Token Counting

Similar to [Response input token counts API](https://developers.openai.com/api/reference/python/resources/responses/subresources/input_tokens/methods/count).

Example response:

```json
{
  "object": "response.input_tokens",
  "input_tokens": 11
}
```

curl http://localhost:9931/v1/chat/completions -d '{
    "model": "gpt-3.5-turbo",
    "messages": [
        {"role": "system", "content": "You are a chatbot that uses tools/functions. Dont overthink things."},
        {"role": "user", "content": "What is the weather in Istanbul?"}
    ],
    "tools": [{
        "type":"function",
        "function":{
            "name":"get_current_weather",
            "description":"Get the current weather in a given location",
            "parameters":{
                "type":"object",
                "properties":{
                    "location":{
                        "type":"string",
                        "description":"The city and country/state, e.g. `San Francisco, CA`, or `Paris, France`"
                    }
                },
                "required":["location"]
            }
        }
    }]
}'
```

